  "title": "epan: Prevent crash when asserting on unvalidated UTF-8 strings",
  "description": "If UTF-8 validation fails, set the fvalue to a sanitized value so that calls\nlater to retrieve it don't null deference and crash. We could,\nespecially for a release, disable the assertion and just sanitize\nbad strings.\n\nRelated to #18363",
